config ELE_PRESSURE
	tristate "ELE-Kernel memory pressure telemetry"
	depends on SYSFS && MMU
	default n
	help
	  Publish a read-only global memory-pressure snapshot with hysteresis.
	  This is advisory telemetry, not a task killer or reclaim controller.
	  Select Y to include it in the ELE-Kernel image.
